1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,223
One more idea.

2
00:00:01,223 --> 00:00:08,906
Perchloric, hydroiodic, hydrobromic, hydrochloric and nitric acids all look equally strong in water.

3
00:00:08,906 --> 00:00:17,044
Each gives its proton to water completely, and the strongest acid that can exist in water is hydronium itself.

4
00:00:17,044 --> 00:00:18,359
Water levels them.

